      "contentExcerpt": "```file:site/styles.css\n/* Momento site styles \u2013 minimal, accessible, print-friendly */\n\n/* Reset & base */\n*,\n*::before,\n*::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\nhtml {\n  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n  background: #0f1117;\n}\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 1rem;\n  max-width: 960px;\n  margin-inline: auto;\n}\nh1 {\n  margin-block: 0 0.5em;\n  font-size: 2rem;\n}\nh2 {\n  margin-block: 1em 0.5em;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n}\na {\n  color: #89b4fa;\n}\na:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\n/* Panels */\n.panel {\n  background: #161b22;\n  border: 1px solid #30363d;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 1rem;\n  margin-block: 1rem;\n}\n.panel.promise {\n  background: #0d2e1a;\n  border-color: #2ea043;\n}\n\n/* Navigation */\n.nav {\n  background: #0f1117;\n  padding: 0.5rem;\n  margin-block-end: 1rem;\n}\n.nav nav {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n}\n.nav a {\n  color: #c9d1d9;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n.nav a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n.footer {\n  margin-block-start: 2rem;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Table */\ntable {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  margin-block: 1rem;\n}\nth,\ntd {\n  border: 1px solid #30363d;\n  padding: 0.5rem;\n  text-align: left;\n}\nth {\n  background: #21262d;\n}\ntbody tr.wake-past td {\n  background: #2d333b;\n}\ntbody tr.wake-current td {\n  background: #eef4ff;\n  color: #0f1117;\n}\ntbody tr.wake-upcoming td {\n  background: #1f2937;\n}\n\n/* Controls */\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.controls button {\n  background: #238636;\n  border: none;\n  color: #fff;\n  padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.controls button:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: #2ea043;\n}\n.controls button:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.5;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n#copy-current-wake-msg,\n#copy-next-wake-msg,\n#copy-days-active-msg,\n#copy-freshness-msg,\n#copy-todays-wakes-msg,\n#copy-waketime-schedule-msg,\n#copy-recent-tweaks-msg,\n#copy-stats-msg,\n#download-waketime-schedule-msg,\n#download-recent-tweaks-msg,\n#download-stats-msg {\n  color: #8b949e;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n}\n\n/* Print */\n@media print {\n  body {\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .nav,\n  .controls,\n  button {\n    display: none;\n  }\n  .panel {\n    break-inside: avoid;\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Accessibility live region */\n[aria-live] {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: -9999px;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* Local date prefix in today's wakes list */\n.local-date-prefix {\n  color: #8b949e;\n  font-weight: normal;\n}\n\n/* Wake status classes for schedule table */\n.wake-past,\n.wake-current,\n.wake-upcoming {\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n```",
